OL,3,GNEWSATwin HS2 viaducts completed after
OL,4,Amajor works
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe longest HS2 viaduct structures in
OL,7,Fthe Midlands have been completed.
OL,9,FThey span the M42 northbound and
OL,10,Fsouthbound and run 1,400 metres in
OL,11,Flength.
OL,13,FThe pair, in the planning since 2022
OL,14,Fand now in place in Water Orton,
OL,15,FWarwickshire, form the upper section of
OL,16,Fthe Delta Junction, which is dubbed the
OL,17,Frailway's answer to Birmingham's
OL,18,Finfamous looping motorway interchange
OL,19,FSpaghetti Junction.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
