OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSATwin HS2 viaducts completed after
OL,4,Amajor works
OL,5,
OL,6,FHS2 Ltd, the company delivering the
OL,7,Fhigh speed railway, says the viaducts
OL,8,Fstand 20 metres at their highest point,
OL,9,Fand will be among the tallest
OL,10,Fstructures along the HS2 route, taking
OL,11,Ftrains over not only the M42, but the
OL,12,FBirmingham to Peterborough rail line
OL,13,Fand the River Tame.
